  "bounded_conclusions": [
    "G23 does not qualify the full endpoint envelope: 19 of 21 preregistered eligible arms meet both physical endpoint and nominal SWAP+ledger handoff criteria; C0_MIXED_POS and C3_MIXED_NEG do not meet the frozen external residual criterion within 12 outer updates.",
    "All 21 diagnostic arms preserve non-authority. Every one of the 19 physically converged arms then passes exactly-one ordinary final candidate reacquisition and the existing sequential SWAP-then-ledger handoff.",
    "The two failures are not participant inadmissibility or safeguard failures: all response attempts have participant status 0, both use zero response contractions, and both end geometrically well inside the 5e-10 m independent-head guard.",
    "C0_MIXED_POS stalls at one binary64 head for all 12 accepted updates with residual 1.0690489807569464e-15 m/s. C3_MIXED_NEG advances only at binary64-scale head increments and ends with residual 2.8454475210978113e-15 m/s.",
    "Using the independently frozen G08 groundwater slope and the final SWAP tangent, the residual-equivalent head corrections are about 5.25e-14 m for C0_MIXED_POS and 2.79e-13 m for C3_MIXED_NEG, both below the STANDARD MODFLOW outer_dvclose of 1e-12 m. This is causal motivation for a separate tolerance-compatibility experiment, not proof that tightening MODFLOW tolerances will resolve the failures.",
    "All reported final heads, including the two failed arms, are within 1.193e-10 m of the independent G08 reference root; therefore the partial classification is driven by the prospectively frozen flux-residual criterion, not the independent head guard.",
    "The fresh-process C0_MIXED_NEG replay is bitwise deterministic for final head, cached final q, response-status topology and ledger exchange.",
    "G21 exact internal trajectory equivalence remains falsified and is not reinterpreted by G23.",
    "No solver tolerance, production coupling policy, tangent rule, response-space globalization rule, retry behavior, HCOF/RHS semantics, or publication architecture is changed or admitted."
  ],
  "next_natural_unit": "Open G24 as a preregistered causal tolerance-compatibility experiment on the two G23 GW_MIXED failures, with matched passing controls and an analytically chosen MODFLOW dvclose ladder. Preserve G23 as PARTIAL_ENDPOINT_ENVELOPE regardless of G24 outcome."
